; layout.link -- rgblink linker script.  Every section is pinned to the address of its original position: `org` + section name.
; A new section that is not listed here floats (rgblink places it in free space of any bank); pin it here to fix its address.
; (RGBDS 1.0.x linker script: `ROM0` / `ROMX $bank` select the bank, `org $addr` places the sections that follow it.)

